---
title: "CommandHistory"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: executing
  s1: buffered
  s2: idle
  s3: revoked
  s4: timeout
  s5: dispatched
  s6: closed
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: Read next command during active statement
  s1 --> s2: Active statement returns
  s2 --> s3: Account is revoked
  s2 --> s4: Idle transaction deadline expires
  s2 --> s5: Dispatch buffered command
  s3 --> s6: Reject next command and close
